{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25134","headline":"山居雨霁即事 · 张碧","name":"山居雨霁即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅苍岭下，自与喧卑隔。\n况值雷雨晴，郊原转岑寂。\n出门看反照，绕屋残溜滴。\n古路绝人行，荒陂响蝼蝈。\n篱崩瓜豆蔓，圃坏牛羊迹。\n断续古祠鸦，高低远村笛。\n喜闻东臯润，欲往未通屐。\n杖策试危桥，攀萝瞰苔壁。\n邻翁夜相访，缓酌聊跂石。\n新月出污尊，浮云在巾舃。\n常隳腐儒操，谬习经邦画。\n有待时未知，非关慕沮溺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}